# The source distribution holds the package, its metadata and the legal files. The test suite, demo data, fixtures,
# specifications and docs stay in the repository: the tests need the full checkout (fixtures, demo, design set).
include LICENSE NOTICE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md README.md pyproject.toml
prune tests
prune demo
prune docs
prune containers
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store
